# Cloudflare static assets headers.
# No Referer on outgoing requests: Hugging Face answers 404 (without CORS) to
# model downloads whose referrer is a *.workers.dev site. Module workers take
# their referrer policy from this header, not from the page's <meta>.
# Security: never shown inside another site's frame (clickjacking), no MIME
# sniffing, no plugins or <base> tricks; of the device's features only the
# microphone (dictation, voice mode). Scripts aren't restricted further:
# WebLLM, ONNX Runtime and Pyodide compile code at runtime.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(self), camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
